# Rules

Use the story summary, story opening, and recent story, whichever are present, and the pending player input as context. Plan the next segment as a continuation of the end of the recent story; use the story opening as the starting point only when no recent story is present. Preserve the player's intended action or words without assuming success. Include the immediate causal response or progress that should follow. Do not write story prose, analysis, headings, JSON, Markdown, or any extra text.

# Output

